[9.2,"o","\r\n"]
[9.26,"o","unstale reads new release notes with a model, on the user's own key or Codex plan.\r\n"]
[9.32,"o","None is set up here. Tell the user and ask which they want. Never ask them to paste a key.\r\n"]
[9.38,"o","\r\n"]
[9.44,"o","  1  Set one up   one line to add, listed below\r\n"]
[9.5,"o","  2  Not now      free · advisories and deprecations only, ≈ 27% of the changes in new releases\r\n"]
[9.56,"o","\r\n"]
[9.62,"o","For 1, they add one line to their shell profile or this repo's .env, then you run `unstale setup`:\r\n"]
[9.68,"o","\r\n"]
[9.74,"o","  OPENAI_API_KEY=<key>      OpenAI\r\n"]
[9.8,"o","  AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=<key>  Vercel AI Gateway\r\n"]
[9.86,"o","  OPENROUTER_API_KEY=<key>  OpenRouter\r\n"]
[9.92,"o","  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=<key>   Anthropic\r\n"]
[9.98,"o","\r\n"]
[10.04,"o","Or use their Codex plan: install Codex and run `codex login`.\r\n"]
[10.1,"o","\r\n"]
[10.16,"o","For 2: unstale setup --inference none\r\n"]
